# Purple Roman Cancel: a 5a that hit nothing (p2 out of reach) is cancelled on frame 3 into neutral.
setup: p1 character scenario_dummy
setup: p2 character scenario_dummy
setup: module meter 5000 0 0 0 10000 0
setup: module roman_cancel 112 3 3 5000 15 6 40 1 2
frame 1: p1 5a
frame 3: p1 5a+b+c

frame 3: expect p1 event module
frame 9: expect p1 state = idle
frame 3: expect module meter[0] = 5000
